cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use these materials, please cite them as below.
  The first two authors contributed equally.
type: software
title: "Marimo at UF: reactive notebooks from the laptop to HiPerGator (workshop materials)"
abstract: >-
  Materials for a two-part workshop on marimo reactive Python notebooks,
  run with UF Research Computing on October 22, 2026. Part 1 covers marimo
  basics, local use, and SQL cells. Part 2 covers using marimo for
  scientific work on the HiPerGator supercomputer.
